                         'curl -sI http://127.0.0.1:8099 | head -1; docker exec csftest wget -qO- -T5 https://ifconfig.me/ip; echo',
                         'csf -r > /dev/null; sleep 5; docker ps --filter name=csftest --format \'{{.Status}}\'',
                         'curl -sI http://127.0.0.1:8099 | head -1; docker exec csftest wget -qO- -T5 https://ifconfig.me/ip; echo',
                         'docker rm -f csftest; docker network rm csftest'))),
         when={'panel': ('directadmin',)}, source='tested 2026-10-29: AlmaLinux 10.2, DirectAdmin, CSF, Docker 29'),
    Step('Swap', 'target',
         'Limits are ceilings, not reservations, so the stage and prod limits together may exceed the RAM. Without swap, if both '
         'reached their ceilings at once, the OOM killer would kill the largest process – often the database. Swap only slows '
         'a peak down; `vm.swappiness=10` uses it only when RAM runs out. If `swapon --show` already shows swap, the step is '
         'not needed. `dd`, not `fallocate`: XFS (AlmaLinux, Rocky) does not always accept a `fallocate` swap file.',
         blocks=((None, ('swapon --show; free -g',
                         'dd if=/dev/zero of=/swapfile bs=1M count=4096 status=progress',
                         'chmod 600 /swapfile && mkswap /swapfile && swapon /swapfile',
                         "echo '/swapfile none swap sw 0 0' >> /etc/fstab",
                         "echo 'vm.swappiness=10' > /etc/sysctl.d/90-swappiness.conf && sysctl -p /etc/sysctl.d/90-swappiness.conf")),),
         source='tested 2026-10-29: AlmaLinux 10.2, DirectAdmin'),
    Step('SELinux', 'target',
         'setup sets no SELinux labels on its directories and is untested with SELinux. If `getenforce` shows Enforcing, '
