    Step('DNS', 'dns',
         'Two records: the site, and its tools (`pma.`, `mailpit.`, `cron.`, `backup.{domain}`) by one wildcard record. With '
         'Cloudflare `{domain}` may be Proxied if it is one level below the zone (the free certificate covers `*.zone`): SSL '
         'mode Full while the server has no certificate, then Full (strict); the server gets the visitor\'s real IP only from '
         '`CF-Connecting-IP`. `*.{domain}` – DNS only: the free certificate does not cover second-level names, and the tools\' '
         'IP lists would see Cloudflare\'s addresses.',
