# --- Instructions: a worked example of adding a project -------------------------------------------
# A whole project added end to end with made-up names: a PrestaShop shop with an environment repository and a
# separate code repository, a stage on a DirectAdmin server, the shop under a path of a shared hostname. It adds
# to the guide what a real run ran into (versions, disk, keys, the host key, the runner, a path prefix).
EXAMPLE_INTRO = ('Example: a PrestaShop shop with the env repo `company/shop_docker` and a separate code repo `company/shop`, '
                 'a stage environment on the DirectAdmin server `server.example.lt` (domain owner `shopuser`), the shop '
                 'under the path `/shop/`, mail – to Mailpit. For your own project change the names; the steps by OS, panel and '
                 'certificate are in the guide "Preparing a server".')
