            'move-bitbucket-ssh', 'Bitbucket SSH: ssh.bitbucket.org', '',
            note='From 2026-11-12 Bitbucket git over SSH – ssh.bitbucket.org only. Moves the remotes of the build directories '
                 '(app/, app/public/) once the new address answers; leaves GitHub alone. Before it – "Prepare the server" (host key).',
